# One private key per line. Blank lines and #-comments are ignored, so a wallet
# can be labelled or temporarily disabled without deleting it.
#
# Copy this file to snipe.keys (which git ignores) and put real keys there.
# Fund these wallets with only what the mint needs — this file sits on a server.
#
# 0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111  # wallet A
# 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222222  # wallet B
